<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Dec consumer prices up 11.41 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Dec consumer prices up 11.41 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's consumer price index increased 11.41 percent in December year-on-year compared with 11.18 percent in November and 12.34 percent in December 1995, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Sunday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as base year, rose 1.39 percent in December 1996 to 188.03 from 186.40 in November. The index stood at 168.78 in December 1995.</p>
<p>					  Dec	 Nov	   Dec 1995</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE  base 1990/91   188.03    186.40	   168.78</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  +0.87     +1.21	    +0.67</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +11.41    +11.18	   +12.34</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
